# Sudoku Solver

## Overview

This Python project implements a Sudoku game with classes representing the Sudoku board, squares, and elements (rows, columns, and boxes). The goal is to solve a 9x9 Sudoku board using a backtracking algorithm.

## Installation

Make sure to have Python3 installed.

## Usage

<path to file>/python3 board.py

